  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21526414",
      "title": "Building a Custom Control Component",
      "lectureOrder": 148,
      "videoOrder": 129,
      "sourceHash": "3044da57582fbfbe63f8aa01c8084acf6d95c490380c7ce84a6134a8578ef88f",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.22,
          "end": 3.82,
          "en": "Thus far, we always worked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.82,
          "end": 6.89,
          "en": "with those built-in form input elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.89,
          "end": 9.78,
          "en": "And of course, you will work with those a lot,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.78,
          "end": 12.64,
          "en": "but sometimes you also need to build your own one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.64,
          "end": 14.42,
          "en": "Well, let's do that now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.42,
          "end": 17.72,
          "en": "I will build a RatingControl element here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.72,
          "end": 20.49,
          "en": "which allows the user to pick a rating.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.49,
          "end": 22.65,
          "en": "So, here we'll have a template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.65,
          "end": 25.97,
          "en": "and I wanna have an unordered list in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.97,
          "end": 28.163,
          "en": "because I will have three choices.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.22,
          "end": 33.56,
          "en": "First choice is, poor.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.56,
          "end": 36.43,
          "en": "Second choice is, average.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.43,
          "end": 38.383,
          "en": "Third choice is, great.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.84,
          "end": 42.09,
          "en": "Now, these choices should be clickable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.09,
          "end": 46.85,
          "en": "So I will actually add buttons here around these words",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.55,
          "end": 51.75,
          "en": "so that we have better semantics,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.75,
          "end": 54.953,
          "en": "and make it a bit more accessible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.85,
          "end": 63.85,
          "en": "And then we can add our scoped styling here, like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 65.03,
          "end": 67.41,
          "en": "Now, I will keep it relatively simple.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 67.41,
          "end": 68.96000000000001,
          "en": "I'll just remove the list style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.96000000000001,
          "end": 70.303,
          "en": "from the unordered list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.28999999999999,
          "end": 73.81,
          "en": "and give it a little bit of margin to top and bottom,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.81,
          "end": 75.69,
          "en": "and no margin left and right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 75.69,
          "end": 80.57,
          "en": "Remove all padding, and set the display style to flex,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 80.57,
          "end": 85.57,
          "en": "to use Flexbox, and then style the list items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 86.06,
          "end": 90.993,
          "en": "to give every item a margin of, 1rem left and right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 91.9,
          "end": 96.9,
          "en": "Give it a border of one pixel solid, and a light gray color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 99.6,
          "end": 102.66,
          "en": "Padding of 1rem here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 102.66,
          "end": 106.00999999999999,
          "en": "and also set the display flex here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 106.00999999999999,
          "end": 110.06,
          "en": "to justify the content in the center on both axis.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 110.06,
          "end": 112.58,
          "en": "If you can't follow along with the styling here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 112.58,
          "end": 114.86,
          "en": "that's no problem, it's not a styling course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 114.86,
          "end": 117.74000000000001,
          "en": "You can just type along here, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 117.74000000000001,
          "end": 122.74,
          "en": "Now, for the button here, I'll give that a font of inherit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 125.18,
          "end": 129.2,
          "en": "no border, and a background color of transparent,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 129.2,
          "end": 132.34,
          "en": "whoops, transparent,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 132.34,
          "end": 134.64,
          "en": "and set the cursor to pointer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 134.64,
          "end": 136.393,
          "en": "to have the proper mouse cursor.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 137.94,
          "end": 140.46,
          "en": "Now, that's my rating control.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 140.46,
          "end": 142.8,
          "en": "In the form I now wanna use it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 142.8,
          "end": 145.12,
          "en": "So here towards the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 145.12,
          "end": 148.5,
          "en": "maybe before the accept terms checkbox,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 148.5,
          "end": 153.42000000000002,
          "en": "I'll add a div with my class of form-control.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 153.42000000000002,
          "end": 157.52,
          "en": "And in there, I'll add my rating-control element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 157.52,
          "end": 158.743,
          "en": "which I just created.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 159.86,
          "end": 162.43,
          "en": "Now, of course, we need to register it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 162.43,
          "end": 164.1,
          "en": "for that to be available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 164.1,
          "end": 166.06,
          "en": "So let's import rating-control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 166.06,
          "end": 168.78300000000002,
          "en": "from, ./RatingControl.vue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 169.84,
          "end": 172.5,
          "en": "and add the components option here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 172.5,
          "end": 176.653,
          "en": "to our configuration object, and add rating-control.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 179.24,
          "end": 183.6,
          "en": "And I'm getting an error that I'm missing an end tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 183.6,
          "end": 186.913,
          "en": "Yes, there should be a closing button tag here, of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 187.77,
          "end": 190.203,
          "en": "So now we got these ratings here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 191.21,
          "end": 195.26,
          "en": "When I press them, they all submit to form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 195.26,
          "end": 197.16,
          "en": "which is definitely not what I want,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 197.16,
          "end": 199.49,
          "en": "but it makes sense because ultimately",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 199.49,
          "end": 202.663,
          "en": "these here are buttons inside of a form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 204.05,
          "end": 207.87,
          "en": "So, to change this in the RatingControl,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 207.87,
          "end": 211.45,
          "en": "I will give these buttons here, a type of button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 211.45,
          "end": 215.44,
          "en": "which overrides the default of being a submit button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 215.44,
          "end": 218.98,
          "en": "so that these buttons will no longer submit a form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 218.98,
          "end": 220.28300000000002,
          "en": "if they are in one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 221.15,
          "end": 222.86,
          "en": "And with that, we now no longer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 222.86,
          "end": 225.2,
          "en": "see that form being submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 225.2,
          "end": 226.63,
          "en": "Now, my idea is simple.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 226.63,
          "end": 230.15,
          "en": "Whatever the user selects here, should be highlighted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 230.15,
          "end": 232.11,
          "en": "and then, of course, should also be saved",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 232.11,
          "end": 234.09300000000002,
          "en": "as part of the overall form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 235.43,
          "end": 238.96,
          "en": "Now, let's work on the internal highlighting first.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 238.96,
          "end": 243.01,
          "en": "For that, we can add a simple class here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 243.01,
          "end": 246.81,
          "en": "active, for example, in the rating-control styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 246.81,
          "end": 251.81,
          "en": "and set the border color to purple here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 253.34,
          "end": 255.2,
          "en": "whichever color you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 255.2,
          "end": 259.753,
          "en": "I will pick this color here, let's say, this one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 262.58,
          "end": 267.251,
          "en": "And I'll select the button inside of an active class element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 267.251,
          "end": 270.453,
          "en": "and give that the same color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 271.69,
          "end": 274.65999999999997,
          "en": "And the active class should be added to the list item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 274.65999999999997,
          "end": 276.62,
          "en": "which is currently active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 276.62,
          "end": 279.6,
          "en": "We can keep track of that by adding a script here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 279.6,
          "end": 281.003,
          "en": "with a data property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 282.02,
          "end": 287.02,
          "en": "And in here, we can store the active option.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 289.12,
          "end": 291.103,
          "en": "And let's say initially, that is null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 292.51,
          "end": 293.93,
          "en": "And when we click a button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 293.93,
          "end": 297.25,
          "en": "the active option should be set to, let's say, A, B and C,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 297.25,
          "end": 299.01,
          "en": "or, poor, average, and great,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 299.01,
          "end": 300.64,
          "en": "and then the respective list items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 300.64,
          "end": 301.74,
          "en": "should be highlighted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 302.88,
          "end": 305.303,
          "en": "For that, we can add methods here, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 307.4,
          "end": 309.253,
          "en": "and add an activate method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 310.37,
          "end": 313.77,
          "en": "And here I want to find out which option that was.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 313.77,
          "end": 316.45,
          "en": "So I'll accept that option argument,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 316.45,
          "end": 320.03,
          "en": "and set this active option equal to option.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 320.03,
          "end": 321.56,
          "en": "And the activate method here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 321.56,
          "end": 324.39,
          "en": "will now be triggered whenever a button is clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 324.39,
          "end": 327.373,
          "en": "So here I call activate for poor,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 329.37,
          "end": 334.253,
          "en": "on the next button, I'll do that for average,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 336.12,
          "end": 339.12,
          "en": "and on the third button, we'll do it for great.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 339.12,
          "end": 341.5,
          "en": "And now we just need to pick this value up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 341.5,
          "end": 345.2,
          "en": "and add the styling to the proper list item element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 345.2,
          "end": 347.79,
          "en": "By binding class dynamically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 347.79,
          "end": 350.22,
          "en": "and adding the active class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 350.22,
          "end": 352.645,
          "en": "which is the class we added down there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 352.645,
          "end": 357.645,
          "en": "if in this case, active option is equal to poor.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 361.89,
          "end": 365.43,
          "en": "And I will now copy that to all the list items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 365.43,
          "end": 369.023,
          "en": "Here I check for average, and here I check for great.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 371.38,
          "end": 376.38,
          "en": "If we save this, we are able to pick different options,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 377.73,
          "end": 379.79,
          "en": "and indeed, it gets highlighted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 379.79,
          "end": 381.23,
          "en": "This is all nice,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 381.23,
          "end": 384.83299999999997,
          "en": "but how can we now connect this to our form?",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
